sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant APIServer as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Manager as codeflare-operator-manager
    participant Reconciler as RayClusterReconciler
    participant Kueue as Kueue<br/>Quota Manager

    Note over User,Kueue: AppWrapper Creation Flow (with Kueue quota)

    User->>APIServer: POST AppWrapper CR<br/>workload.codeflare.dev/v1beta2
    APIServer->>MutWH: /mutate-workload-codeflare-dev-v1beta2-appwrapper<br/>TLS, Admission Auth
    MutWH-->>APIServer: Mutated AppWrapper<br/>(inject defaults)
    APIServer->>ValWH: /validate-workload-codeflare-dev-v1beta2-appwrapper<br/>TLS, Admission Auth
    ValWH-->>APIServer: Admission Response (Allow/Deny)
    APIServer-->>User: AppWrapper created

    APIServer->>Manager: Watch event: AppWrapper created
    Manager->>Kueue: PodSetInfos (labels, annotations,<br/>nodeSelectors, tolerations, schedulingGates)
    Kueue-->>Manager: Quota admission decision

    Note over User,Kueue: RayCluster Lifecycle Flow

    User->>APIServer: POST RayCluster CR<br/>ray.io/v1
    APIServer->>MutWH: /mutate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>TLS, Admission Auth
    MutWH-->>APIServer: Mutated RayCluster
    APIServer->>ValWH: /validate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>TLS, Admission Auth
    ValWH-->>APIServer: Admission Response (Allow/Deny)
    APIServer-->>User: RayCluster created

    APIServer->>Reconciler: Watch event: RayCluster created (For)
    Reconciler->>APIServer: Create Service (Owns)
    Reconciler->>APIServer: Create ServiceAccount (Owns)
    Reconciler->>APIServer: Create NetworkPolicy (Owns)
    Reconciler->>APIServer: Create Ingress (Owns)
    Reconciler->>APIServer: Create Route (Owns, OpenShift)
    Reconciler->>APIServer: Watch ClusterRoleBindings

    Note over User,Kueue: Multi-Framework Workload Orchestration

    Manager->>APIServer: Create/Manage RayJobs (ray.io)
    Manager->>APIServer: Create/Manage PyTorchJobs (kubeflow.org)
    Manager->>APIServer: Create/Manage JobSets (jobset.x-k8s.io)
    Manager->>APIServer: Create PodGroups<br/>(scheduling.sigs.k8s.io + scheduling.x-k8s.io)

    Note over User,Kueue: Platform Integration

    Manager->>APIServer: GET DSCInitialization CR<br/>Read platform state
    APIServer-->>Manager: DSCI status

    Note over User,Kueue: Health & Metrics

    APIServer->>Manager: GET /healthz (8081/TCP HTTP)
    Manager-->>APIServer: 200 OK
    APIServer->>Manager: GET /readyz (8081/TCP HTTP)
    Manager-->>APIServer: 200 OK
